  "description": "In order to catch trespassers in an art academy, Kang Baram and Han Dajeong stay behind. As soon as they hear the culprits enter, the two hide in a closet in a hurry, but are surprised to see an unexpected sex scene unfold before them, and the two lose their chance to jump out of their hiding spot. As the two stuffed in a tight enclosure in an uncomfortable position, awkward tension between the two, Baram develops an erection... After Dajeong sees Baram's embarrassed expression, he remembers him being his one-night stand, but Baram begs him to forget about what happened. \"So you... had sex with me, but now you're throwing me away like some measly trash?\"",
